# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Regenerable Quarto build output from the single-file-render quirk.
# output-dir is docs/, which is gitignored above (CI builds the real site).
# But `quarto render <file>.qmd` on a single file writes <file>.html into the
# working tree (and errors trying to rename it into docs/). Those .html /
# .json / feed / index_files / site_libs outputs are transient build artifacts,
# never committed: every authored page is a .qmd (no .html is tracked). The
# four content trees _extensions/ resources/ theme/ teaching/ hold real source
# and are NOT matched by these patterns (they are root-scoped / specific).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*.html
/*.json
/*.feed-full-staged
/en/*.html
/fr/*.html
/site_libs/

posts/*/index.html
posts/*/index_files/
talks/*/index.html
mscsi/*/index.html
